 "effector": "hand_r",
 "_design": "Overlord jab 2 v3 (ANIM-JAB-5, 2026-11-12) from cards/overlord/jab/overlord_jab_v3_pose_plan.md: villain claw slap with a step forward, then he looks at his hand. f0 = jab 1 f12. f3 weight onto the right foot, f6 windup (left knee up, chest 55 right, claw high behind the head), f8 left foot lands heel first, f9 contact in a deep lunge with the arm on a descending diagonal, f13 rake to low-left at the lowest point, f20 observe (forearm vertical in front of the face) held to the FAF f26; tremor f27-37 lives in the Manuale layer; clench f38-41, head up first, right foot steps up to the idle stance f41-47, idle f52 30 cm ahead of the start. r2: the observe/tremor beat is gone from the card (f26-52 settle); the Manuale tremor layer f27-37 still needs a decision.",
 "_changes": "v3: new card, nothing reused from v2 (rejected in game as static). r1 (2026-11-14, offline, owner notes round 1): root motion removed (no root_ctrl edits), the 18 cm step is in pose space (left foot +18 f4-f9, pelvis.loc forward over it), right foot planted on the jab 1 stomp spot until f46, recovery: left foot steps back f41-46, right foot shuffles back to idle f46-50, f52 exact idle at the origin (net travel 0). Windup keys f4/f5 added (hand rises and goes back every frame f0-f6), f1 key (42% toward the break), contact hand at chest height on the target's near side, rear leg long, heel up. Backup: overlord_jab2_v3.r0.backup.json. r2 (2026-11-15, offline, review r1): f0 = 50% from the NEW jab 1 hold toward the break, windup re-spaced f0-f6; contact lunge shifted left (pelvis +8/+23.5, chest leans left 10), wrist (-20, 80, 128) outside the own outline from behind; arm lowers f12-f17 in 4-12 cm steps; step back f15-f23 (left f16-19, right f20-23), f26 near idle, f26-52 settle; observe pose removed; every frame 0-26 keyed. Backup: overlord_jab2_v3.r1.backup.json.",
 "_tremor": "Not in the card: the hand tremor f27-37 is keyed on hand_r_fk_ctrl Rotation in the additive 'Manuale' section of LS_OverlordJab2V3_Build (see v2 _tremor), zero at f26 and f38.",
